The router's [logger](https://github.com/kserve/kserve/blob/master/cmd/router/main.go#L205) is not configurable. Being an orchestrator and caller of so many nodes(ISVCs in IG), router's logs should have trace id in it that can help trace the request flow end-to-end.
This will let users see the whole trace of how a request went through end-to-end.

Every company has their own tracing headers that they use and putting these tracing headers as part of log lines (via log formatter) is super helpful in tracing the flow.

We should let the user influence the router's logging config via `router` section of `inferenceservice-config` configmap. 

```
